  "description": "✏️ Comic Doodle – Fun & Sketchy Kids Display Font 🎨\nBring a touch of hand-drawn charm to your designs with Comic Doodle! This playful display font features a unique “sketch” style with double outlines and organic imperfections that mimic a real pencil drawing. It’s the perfect choice for projects that need to feel friendly, creative, and full of life.\nWhether you’re creating educational worksheets, comic book titles, or personalized birthday décor, Comic Doodle stands out with its bold presence and whimsical vibe. It is highly legible and works perfectly for both digital designs and physical crafts!\n🏫 Perfect For:\n📚 School & Education (Worksheets, book covers, classroom labels)\n🖍️ Kids’ Content (Coloring books, comic strips, YouTube thumbnails)\n👕 Creative Apparel (T-shirts, hoodies, canvas bags)\n🎂 Party Decor (Invitations, banners, stickers)\n✂️ DIY Crafting (Vinyl cutting, scrapbooking, sublimation)\nUnleash your imagination with Comic Doodle—the font where every letter tells a story! ✍️✨",
  "fullDescription": "<p>✏️ Comic Doodle – Fun &amp; Sketchy Kids Display Font 🎨<br>\nBring a touch of hand-drawn charm to your designs with Comic Doodle! This playful display font features a unique “sketch” style with double outlines and organic imperfections that mimic a real pencil drawing. It’s the perfect choice for projects that need to feel friendly, creative, and full of life.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating educational worksheets, comic book titles, or personalized birthday décor, Comic Doodle stands out with its bold presence and whimsical vibe. It is highly legible and works perfectly for both digital designs and physical crafts!</p>\n<p>🏫 Perfect For:</p>\n<p>📚 School &amp; Education (Worksheets, book covers, classroom labels)<br>\n🖍️ Kids’ Content (Coloring books, comic strips, YouTube thumbnails)<br>\n👕 Creative Apparel (T-shirts, hoodies, canvas bags)<br>\n🎂 Party Decor (Invitations, banners, stickers)<br>\n✂️ DIY Crafting (Vinyl cutting, scrapbooking, sublimation)</p>\n<p>Unleash your imagination with Comic Doodle—the font where every letter tells a story! ✍️✨</p>",
